{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"沃伦·巴菲特·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"warren-buffett","categoryLabel":"沃伦·巴菲特","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.52,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3,"coverage":3,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/34_warren-buffett/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"沃伦-巴菲特-生平与事业\">沃伦·巴菲特·生平与事业</h1><p>本 hub 讲述沃伦·巴菲特（Warren Buffett，1930– ）从奥马哈一个痴迷数字的萧条年代少年，成长为&quot;奥马哈先知&quot;、把一家衰败纺织厂改造成投资帝国的<strong>人生轨迹</strong>。它回答的是&quot;他经历了什么、这些经历如何塑造了他&quot;，而非&quot;他的投资方法是什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-生平-而非方法论\">本 hub 的定位：生平，而非方法论</h2><p>巴菲特的 6 个兄弟 hub 各有分工，本 hub 是<strong>时间线主轴</strong>，其余为主题切面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与事业（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他经历了什么、如何被塑造</td>\n<td>提供时间线骨架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他做成了什么（价值投资、伯克希尔、标志投资）</td>\n<td>本 hub 的事件在此深挖成就</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他怎么想、怎么做（哲学、护城河、与芒格）</td>\n<td>本 hub 的转向在此系统化为方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要作品</a></td>\n<td>业绩记录、股东信、慈善</td>\n<td>本 hub 人生的产出物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他改变了什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 之后的回响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>如何被批评与盖棺</td>\n<td>对本 hub 叙事的多方校正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界约定</strong>：本 hub 提到价值投资、护城河、浮存金等概念时，只交代它们在生平中&quot;何时出现、起了什么作用&quot;，方法论本身的完整解剖一律指向 hub 2 与 hub 3，避免重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 奥马哈的童年] --&gt; B[2 少年资本家]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 价值投资的根基]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 合伙公司岁月]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 接管伯克希尔]&#10;    F --&gt; G[→ hub2 核心贡献 / hub3 思想与方法]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 奥马哈的童年] --&gt; B[2 少年资本家]\n    B --&gt; C[3 格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚]\n    C --&gt; D[4 价值投资的根基]\n    D --&gt; E[5 合伙公司岁月]\n    E --&gt; F[6 接管伯克希尔]\n    F --&gt; G[→ hub2 核心贡献 / hub3 思想与方法]</pre><p>按章节顺序读即可，因果链环环相扣：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"early-life/childhood-in-omaha\">奥马哈的童年</a> — 大萧条出身、数字天赋、复利早慧，性格地基。</li>\n<li><a href=\"early-life/the-young-capitalist\">少年资本家</a> — 6 岁卖可乐到 11 岁第一支股票，复利信仰落地。</li>\n<li><a href=\"education-and-mentor/graham-and-columbia\">格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚</a> — 遇见恩师，直觉获得理论框架。</li>\n<li><a href=\"education-and-mentor/value-investing-roots\">价值投资的根基</a> — 安全边际、市场先生与&quot;从便宜到伟大&quot;的演进。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-berkshire-path/the-partnership-years\">合伙公司岁月</a> — 1956–1969，年化约 29.5%、无亏损年的实战验证。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-berkshire-path/taking-over-berkshire\">接管伯克希尔</a> — 1965 接管纺织厂，改造为复利平台。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：无需金融基础。若想边读边补方法论，可在读完第 4 篇后跳读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/investment-philosophy/\">思想与方法·投资哲学</a>，再回到第 5、6 篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿全-hub-的三条主线\">贯穿全 hub 的三条主线</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>复利信仰</strong>：从童年的雪球直觉，到合伙公司 29.5% 的年化，再到伯克希尔的浮存金杠杆——一条数学主线。</li>\n<li><strong>价值投资的进化</strong>：格雷厄姆的&quot;捡烟蒂&quot; → 芒格影响下的&quot;以合理价买伟大公司&quot;，方法被资金规模逼着升级。深挖见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/value-investing/\">核心贡献·价值投资</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>诚信与纪律</strong>：合伙费用结构、巅峰主动解散、坦承伯克希尔之错——人格特质如何成为竞争优势。其评价与争议见 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本 hub 全部关键日期与数字（1930 出生、1942 第一支股票、1956 合伙公司、1965 接管伯克希尔、约 29.5% 年化）均经核验，逐篇内联来源（主要为维基百科 Warren Buffett / Berkshire Hathaway 词条及 CNBC 报道）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年与启蒙","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-in-omaha","title":"奥马哈的童年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life/childhood-in-omaha"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-young-capitalist","title":"少年资本家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life/the-young-capitalist"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"education-and-mentor","title":"求学与恩师","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graham-and-columbia","title":"格雷厄姆与哥伦比亚","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor/graham-and-columbia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-investing-roots","title":"价值投资的根基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/education-and-mentor/value-investing-roots"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-berkshire-path","title":"伯克希尔之路","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-partnership-years","title":"合伙公司岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/the-partnership-years"},{"seq":2,"slug":"taking-over-berkshire","title":"接管伯克希尔","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/taking-over-berkshire"}]}]}